 ## Unreleased
 
+- Best available no longer picks wheelchair spaces, and `seat_states` reports an open one as
+  `wheelchair`. They can still be held, sold and exchanged into by name.
 - Concession prices (all but adult) are rounded to the nearest 50 pence, halves up.
 - Exchanges charge `exchange_fee` (default 100 pence) and are recorded in the ledger as one
   `exchange` entry with the amount settled, instead of a refund and a sale.
